{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunday School</strong> is a short psychological horror inspired by surreal titles like The Exit 8 an P.T.\u00a0 Step into a distorted world born from children\u2019s drawings.\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 30\u201360+ minutes of tense, immersive gameplay, you\u2019ll descend through haunting visions that blur the line between innocence and nightmare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/0374c2712eb1534f309ff91d751da50c.poster.avif?t=1763755520\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/0374c2712eb1534f309ff91d751da50c.webm?t=1763755520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/0374c2712eb1534f309ff91d751da50c.mp4?t=1763755520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in a child\u2019s mind, where trauma takes the form of a looping <strong>Sunday School</strong> corridor, you must distinguish normal rooms from those tainted by disturbing anomalies. Only by choosing correctly you can break the loop. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Choose wrong exit from the room, and the cycle begins again.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the signs guiding your way, and descend through all eight floors to uncover the unsettling truth that waits below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/196aee86278861bc14cac6f1aedbac64.poster.avif?t=1763755520\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/196aee86278861bc14cac6f1aedbac64.webm?t=1763755520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/196aee86278861bc14cac6f1aedbac64.mp4?t=1763755520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLE ENDINGS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story doesn't end with just one playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the game to find all the anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each anomaly is a key that brings you closer to the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three main endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the developer:\u00a0</i>This is a free game made with love, if you\u2019d like to support future development, take a look at my other titles.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Enter The Nightmare","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4053380/1ad68b2956a9c03d1e99f04b6fc0b3103a846e7a.jpg"},{"name":"Dark Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4053380/54ee457474646cf34633bd8ab36c3db0bf4cd607.jpg"},{"name":"Light Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4053380/c6a188832ad5fc9d686a021b646d72b3f00e4880.jpg"},{"name":"Secret Ending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4053380/d33d66f355adc190ebaa953d0e4353a2ff04b3f2.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4053380?t=1763755520","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/63892386b9e5edea843490db6f6feca7f756a6ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763755520","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st