s=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Choose wrong exit from the room, and the cycle begins again.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention to the signs guiding your way, and descend through all eight floors to uncover the unsettling truth that waits below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/196aee86278861bc14cac6f1aedbac64.poster.avif?t=1763755520\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/196aee86278861bc14cac6f1aedbac64.webm?t=1763755520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/extras/196aee86278861bc14cac6f1aedbac64.mp4?t=1763755520\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MULTIPLE ENDINGS</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story doesn't end with just one playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay the game to find all the anomalies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each anomaly is a key that brings you closer to the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three main endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From the developer:\u00a0</i>This is a free game made with love, if you\u2019d like to support future development, take a look at my other titles.</p>","developers":["Artur Latkovsky"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4053380/58339af0938799f7630100986fb613d0f101212c/header.jpg?t=1763755520","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4053380/17184